sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as Public Web Page
  participant Public as Public API
  participant DB as Database

  S->>UI: Open share link
  activate UI
  UI->>Public: GET /public/mini-courses/{shareToken}
  activate Public
  Public->>DB: Find mini-course by token
  activate DB
  DB-->>Public: Mini-course / not found
  deactivate DB

  alt [token valid]
    Public-->>UI: Lesson + quiz payload
    UI-->>S: Display lesson and quiz
  else [token invalid/expired]
    Public-->>UI: 404 Not Found
    UI-->>S: Show invalid link message
  end

  deactivate Public

  deactivate UI
